    "body": "I looked this up. \"either\" requires a singular form of the verb when all the enumerated things are singular.  So \"is\" was grammatically correct.  However, since you mean \"inclusive or\" and not \"exclusive or\", I think you should remove the word \"either\" and use the plural \"are\".",
